@baseUrl = http://localhost:5056

### CREATE DENTAL SERVICE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/dentalservices
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Wisdom Tooth Consultation",
  "category": "Oral Surgery",
  "description": "Consultation and assessment for wisdom tooth treatment.",
  "price": 130.00,
  "durationMinutes": 30
}


###GET Dental Service ID# 21
GET http://localhost:5056/api/dentalservices/21



### UPDATE DENTAL SERVICE
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/dentalservices/21
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Wisdom Tooth Assessment",
  "category": "Oral Surgery",
  "description": "Full consultation and assessment for wisdom tooth treatment and extraction.",
  "price": 160.00,
  "durationMinutes": 45,
  "isActive": true
}



### TEST VALIDATION - INVALID SERVICE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/dentalservices
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "category": "",
  "description": "",
  "price": -50,
  "durationMinutes": 0
}


### DEACTIVATE DENTAL SERVICE
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/dentalservices/21
Accept: application/json


### VERIFY SERVICE AFTER DEACTIVATION
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dentalservices/21
Accept: application/json